  "text_md": "<!-- image -->\n\n## SSP Putty &amp; Putty Pads\n\nSpecSeal SSP Firestop Putty excels at sealing cabling penetrations and outlet boxes. SSP Putty is non-hardening and easily hand works around grouped cabling penetrations forming a re-enterable seal allowing for future work. When applied to outlet boxes; SSP Putty easily works into voids and seams forming a continuous seal against fire, smoke; and hot gases.\n\n## Features &amp; Benefits\n\n- Available in bars or preformed pads\n- Remains pliable and workable for the lifetime of the installation\n- Acoustically tested\n- Will not harden over time\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n## ORDERING INFORMATION\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n| Catalog Number   |   UPC Number | Size                                                | (EOM) Qty.   |   Case Qty. | Weight (Each)      |\n|------------------|--------------|-----------------------------------------------------|--------------|-------------|--------------------|\n| SSPIOO           | 730573021057 |                                                     |              |             | 2.22 Ibs (1.01 kg) |\n| SSP28            | 730573021019 | 24 in? (0 liter) bar                                |              |             | 1.42 Ibs (0.64 kg) |\n| SSPAS            |  73057302200 |                                                     |              |          20 | 0.64 Ibs (0.29 kg) |\n| SSP9S            |  73057302300 | 9.00\" x 9.00 x 3/16\" (229 mm x 229 mm x 4.8 mm) pad |              |          20 | 0.85 Ibs (0.39 kg) |\n\nTEST STANDARDS: ASTM E814 (UL 1479), CAN/ULC-S115, UL263\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n[Click here to learn more about](https://www.stifirestop.com/products/ssp-firestop-putty/)\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->\n\n<!-- image -->",
